{"seq":3,"slug":"referral-system-scale-architecture-governance","title":"推荐系统规模化与架构治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/fraud-abuse-measurement-scale/referral-system-scale-architecture-governance","wordCount":3142,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐系统规模化与架构治理\">推荐系统规模化与架构治理</h1><p>一个推荐计划在灰度阶段跑得很好，卡点往往不是奖励设计，而是第一次大促：分享链路 QPS 翻二十倍、推荐码分配器撞号、风控实时评分排队超过结算窗口、活动配置的第五次静默修改无人能追溯。规模把三类隐患放大到不可忽视——<strong>热点的串行分配</strong>、<strong>同步链路里塞进的评分计算</strong>、<strong>被当作数据而非代码管理的活动配置</strong>。本文讨论如何把系统治理成一条可预测、可回滚、可审计的流水线，并说明每层扩容在哪里开始失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-规模拐点与系统先崩的四处\">核心概念：规模拐点与系统先崩的四处</h2><p>推荐系统的负载曲线不平滑，它由三个脉冲叠加：日常分享、大促开闸、作弊团伙的批量脚本。三者压力点各异，因此「加机器」很少是正确答案——真正的拐点出现在架构的串行结构里。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拐点</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>治理手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>码空间耗尽 / 撞号</td>\n<td>短码长度固定、分配器自增</td>\n<td>生成失败或重复绑定</td>\n<td>号段池 + 组合 ID + 离线预生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因事件乱序</td>\n<td>关系确认与资格动作并发</td>\n<td>同一被邀请人被两次归因</td>\n<td>按 <code>referral_id</code> 分区 + 关系版本号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控排队超时</td>\n<td>脉冲流量下同步评分</td>\n<td>通过率骤降或放行未评分请求</td>\n<td>异步评分 + 前置低成本拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置写放大</td>\n<td>大促前反复调参</td>\n<td>事故后无法判定当时生效的规则版本</td>\n<td>配置即代码，灰度 + 回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一个拐点最容易被低估。短码（如 6 位 Base62）的空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>62</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>5.68</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">62^{6} \\approx 5.68 \\times 10^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.68</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，看似充裕，但若按用户 ID 哈希映射而不做冲突重试，碰撞概率按生日问题增长，在发行量达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 时碰撞期望约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2 / (2N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。发行一亿码时，期望碰撞已到不可忽略的量级。正确做法不是加长码，而是把码从「全局唯一随机量」改成「带命名空间的组合量」：号段前缀（活动 ID）+ 段内单调序列，段与段的冲突面被彻底隔开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构分层-从事件总线到台账的因果链\">架构分层：从事件总线到台账的因果链</h2><p>规模化推荐系统的稳定形态是一条<strong>事件驱动的因果链</strong>，而不是一组互相 RPC 调用的同步服务。原因很直接：归因、风控、台账、度量四件事对延迟、一致性、失败处置的要求完全不同，把它们绑在一次同步调用里，等于让最慢、最脆的一环决定整条链路的可用性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[客户端分享/点击事件] --&gt; B[接入层&lt;br/&gt;限流 + 幂等键 + 设备指纹采集]&#10;  B --&gt; C[归因事件总线&lt;br/&gt;按 referral_id 分区保序]&#10;  C --&gt; D[归因服务&lt;br/&gt;关系生命周期状态机]&#10;  C --&gt; E[风控流式评分&lt;br/&gt;设备/IP/行为/图特征]&#10;  D --&gt; F[奖励台账&lt;br/&gt;复式 append-only 分录]&#10;  E --&gt;|风险分高于阈值| G[待复核队列&lt;br/&gt;隔离负债科目]&#10;  E --&gt;|通过| F&#10;  F --&gt; H[发放与打款编排&lt;br/&gt;幂等出款]&#10;  G --&gt; I[图复核&lt;br/&gt;团伙连通分量]&#10;  I --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; J[度量宽表&lt;br/&gt;归因窗口 + 增量口径]&#10;  H --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[客户端分享/点击事件] --&gt; B[接入层&lt;br/&gt;限流 + 幂等键 + 设备指纹采集]\n  B --&gt; C[归因事件总线&lt;br/&gt;按 referral_id 分区保序]\n  C --&gt; D[归因服务&lt;br/&gt;关系生命周期状态机]\n  C --&gt; E[风控流式评分&lt;br/&gt;设备/IP/行为/图特征]\n  D --&gt; F[奖励台账&lt;br/&gt;复式 append-only 分录]\n  E --&gt;|风险分高于阈值| G[待复核队列&lt;br/&gt;隔离负债科目]\n  E --&gt;|通过| F\n  F --&gt; H[发放与打款编排&lt;br/&gt;幂等出款]\n  G --&gt; I[图复核&lt;br/&gt;团伙连通分量]\n  I --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; J[度量宽表&lt;br/&gt;归因窗口 + 增量口径]\n  H --&gt; J</pre><p>这条链有三条治理纪律，缺一条就会在规模下退化：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，分区键是因果序的载体。</strong> 总线按 <code>referral_id</code>（或 <code>inviter_id</code>）分区，保证同一推荐关系的所有事件落在同一 partition、按写入顺序被消费。若按随机键分区，关系确认与资格动作可能乱序到达，导致「先看到核销、后看到建立关系」——台账上表现为一笔无主分录。分区键的选择不是性能参数，而是正确性参数。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，风控必须是旁路而非主路。</strong> 评分需要查设备指纹、历史行为、图邻域，这些读放大在一次请求里不可控。做法是把评分做成事件总线上独立的消费者组，主链路只做一次低成本的同步拦截（黑名单、频率阈值、幂等键判重）。延迟敏感的动作（点击、分享）用同步拦截；金额敏感的动作（发放、打款）在异步评分完成后才放行。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，台账只追加。</strong> 这一条已在 <a href=\"../reward-ledger-fulfillment-operations/reward-ledger-accounting-model\">奖励台账与账务记账模型</a> 展开：计提、核销、失效、追回都写成不可变分录，撤销即反向分录。规模下的价值在于——风控在 T+7 判定团伙作弊时，你无需修改历史，只需追加一批追回分录，且这批分录本身成为作弊追回额指标的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反作弊算力与延迟预算\">反作弊算力与延迟预算</h2><p>反作弊在规模下的主要矛盾是<strong>算力预算</strong>与<strong>判定时效</strong>的权衡。全量同步深度评分会让大促链路雪崩；只做事后批量审计则作弊资金早已出款。</p>\n<p>可行的分层是三级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>判定时机</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n<th>成本量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 同步拦截</td>\n<td>请求内 (&lt;50ms)</td>\n<td>幂等键判重、黑名单、频率阈值、设备指纹命中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 流式评分</td>\n<td>秒级～分钟级</td>\n<td>同设备多账号计数、IP 聚集、行为速率异常</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 图与批量</td>\n<td>小时级～天级</td>\n<td>团伙连通分量、标签传播、共享支付/地址发现</td>\n<td>高，可离线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L2 的关键是<strong>近似而非精确</strong>去重与计数：在亿级基数的去重场景里，精确集合的内存成本不可接受，工业界用基数估计（HyperLogLog，Flajolet 等，2007）与布隆过滤器（Bloom，1970）把内存压到常数级，代价是概率性误差。设计时必须显式声明误差预算——「同一设备账号数」这类计数若误差 ±2%，阈值判定就要留出相应余量，否则真实团伙在 4 个账号时被漏判。</p>\n<p>L3 的图计算是团伙识别的核心。把「设备指纹、支付工具、收货地址、IP 段」作为节点间的边，作弊团伙在图上表现为<strong>异常稠密的连通分量</strong>，而真实社交推荐表现为稀疏、以自然人为中心的星型或链型。判定的不是「有没有边」，而是「边的密度、类型组合与分量大小」。工程上用弱连通分量（WCC）先做候选切分，再对候选子图用局部指标（团伙内边数 / 节点数）精排。这套计算可完全离线跑，十亿节点也不阻塞主链路。</p>\n<p>需留意一处耦合：L1 的设备指纹采集必须在<strong>接入层</strong>完成并写入事件，否则 L3 的图就没有边；SDK 采集字段与版本治理因此是一等公民。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置与规则治理-把活动配置当代码发布\">配置与规则治理：把活动配置当代码发布</h2><p>推荐系统事故复盘里反复出现同一句话：「当时生效的是哪一版规则？」回答不了这句话，意味着系统不可治理。活动条款、奖励额度、风控阈值、归因窗口长度，这些看起来是「运营参数」的东西，实际是<strong>决定资金流向的逻辑</strong>，必须按代码治理。</p>\n<p>四条纪律：</p>\n<p><strong>声明式与版本化。</strong> 配置以带版本的不可变对象存在（每次改动产生新版本，而非覆盖旧行），生效配置由「活动 ID + 生效时间」指针决定，任何时点都能回放「那一分钟生效的是哪版」。</p>\n<p><strong>灰度与回滚是同一套机制。</strong> 新规则先在影子模式（shadow，只计算不执行）跑，与线上规则对拍差异；再按流量百分比灰度；出问题按版本指针一键回滚。风控规则灰度尤其重要——阈值收紧会误伤真实用户，灰度能先量化误伤率。</p>\n<p><strong>变更留痕与审批。</strong> 谁在何时因为什么改了奖励上限，必须能从系统读出来，而不是从聊天记录里翻。这既是运维需求也是合规需求：GDPR 第 22 条对自动化个体决策的可解释与可追溯要求，直接落在风控判定上。</p>\n<p><strong>自动化决策不得静默改账。</strong> 风控可以自动拒绝一笔发放，但要留下可复核的决策记录与申诉入口。规模下人工只会看被系统标出的部分，因此<strong>标出什么</strong>本身就是要治理的策略，而非随手设的阈值。## 容量与 SLO：为脉冲流量做规划</p>\n<p>推荐系统的容量规划必须假设脉冲。基础流量到峰值流量的放大系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（大促开闸、红包雨、直播跳转）在实践中可达 20 倍以上，而活动前内部造势与作弊脚本会叠加在其上。可用的规划式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>need</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{peak}} = \\lambda_{\\text{base}} \\times B, \\qquad C_{\\text{need}} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\lambda_{\\text{peak}} \\cdot \\bar{T}}{U_{\\max}} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">need</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4471em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是日常 QPS，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单请求平均服务时间（秒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的最大利用率（一般取 0.6–0.7，为突发留余量），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>need</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{need}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">need</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是所需并发服务单元数。这个式子来自利特尔法则（Little&#39;s Law，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>）的直接变形，价值在于把「要不要扩容」从感觉变成可复算的量。</p>\n<p>异步链路还要单独验证<strong>排空条件</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu &gt; \\lambda_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：消费者处理能力必须严格大于峰值到达率，否则队列无界增长，延迟最终表现为「风控判定在出款之后才回来」——此时拦截已无意义。公开工程实践中反复出现的结论是：队列深度必须作为一等 SLO 指标监控，而非只在积压告警时才看。</p>\n<p>SLO 的落地参照 Google SRE 体系（《Site Reliability Engineering》，O&#39;Reilly，2016）：为「归因事件端到端延迟」「发放成功率」「风控判定覆盖率」分别定义目标与错误预算，错误预算耗尽即冻结非必要变更。推荐系统的一个特有指标是<strong>未评分放行率</strong>——因评分超时被放行的请求占比。它必须被显式监控并设上限，否则风控会在最需要它的脉冲时刻静默失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多区域与数据驻留下的归因一致性\">多区域与数据驻留下的归因一致性</h2><p>跨境推荐系统天然多区域部署，而多个司法辖区的数据驻留要求（如 GDPR 对个人数据跨境传输的限制）迫使推荐关系数据留在用户所在区域。这与「全局唯一推荐关系」直接冲突：邀请人和被邀请人可能分属不同区域。</p>\n<p>工程上通常采用<strong>区域归属 + 中心对账</strong>：推荐关系的权威副本归属被邀请人所在区域，跨区邀请通过事件复制到中心对账层做去重与冲突消解，而非让两个区域同时写同一份权威数据。冲突消解规则（同一被邀请人被两地同时归因时谁赢）必须显式定义，常见优先级是「首次有效归因 + 关系建立时间戳」，并把冲突计数作为治理指标暴露——冲突率突升往往意味着设备指纹或身份拼接逻辑出了问题，而这类问题在分区视图里看不见。</p>\n<p>跨区复制的延迟会让「关系建立」与「关系可见」之间出现窗口，度量口径必须承认它：把归因计数按「事件发生时间」而非「处理时间」归属，否则跨区事件会被算进错误的日期，推荐贡献曲线会出现人为尖刺。身份拼接与跨设备归一见 <a href=\"../referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/attribution-identity-stitching-mechanism\">归因与身份拼接机制</a>；归因窗口与增量口径见 <a href=\"../referral-program-model-incentive-design/referral-incentive-economics-incrementality\">激励经济学与增量性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>推荐系统的规模化问题，本质是<strong>把不确定的负载放进确定的架构约束里</strong>。四处拐点（码空间、事件乱序、风控排队、配置写放大）都不是靠加机器解决的，而是靠改变串行结构、把成本分层、把配置当代码。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分区键是正确性参数</strong>：按 <code>referral_id</code> 分区保序，是归因不乱序的前提。</li>\n<li><strong>风控旁路化</strong>：L1 同步拦截、L2 流式评分、L3 图批量，三层各有独立延迟与成本预算。</li>\n<li><strong>近似算法要显式声明误差</strong>：HyperLogLog / 布隆过滤器的概率误差必须进入阈值余量。</li>\n<li><strong>配置即代码</strong>：版本化、影子对拍、灰度、一键回滚、变更留痕，四者缺一不可。</li>\n<li><strong>容量按脉冲规划</strong>：用利特尔法则变形复算并发需求，并单独验证异步链路的排空条件。</li>\n<li><strong>跨区归因靠区域归属 + 中心对账</strong>：冲突规则显式，冲突率作为治理指标。</li>\n<li><strong>未评分放行率必须被监控</strong>：它是风控在峰值时刻是否真的生效的唯一诚实指标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐系统规模化与架构治理","id":"推荐系统规模化与架构治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：规模拐点与系统先崩的四处","id":"核心概念-规模拐点与系统先崩的四处"},{"level":2,"text":"架构分层：从事件总线到台账的因果链","id":"架构分层-从事件总线到台账的因果链"},{"level":2,"text":"反作弊算力与延迟预算","id":"反作弊算力与延迟预算"},{"level":2,"text":"配置与规则治理：把活动配置当代码发布","id":"配置与规则治理-把活动配置当代码发布"},{"level":2,"text":"多区域与数据驻留下的归因一致性","id":"多区域与数据驻留下的归因一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推荐度量与增量实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/fraud-abuse-measurement-scale/referral-measurement-incrementality-experiment"},"next":null}